{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִירָם","hw":"אֲבִירָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִירָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>(<em>the</em>) <em>Exalted One is</em> (<em>my</em>) <em>father</em> (v. Bae<sup>Rel 156</sup>) cf. Assyrian <em>Aburamu</em> (?) KAT<sup>2 479</sup> cf. Dl<sup>L2, p. 91, 1. 225</sup><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Reubenite, son of Eliab <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:1\" href=\"/Numbers.16.1\">Nu 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:12\" href=\"/Numbers.16.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:24\" href=\"/Numbers.16.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:25\" href=\"/Numbers.16.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:27\" href=\"/Numbers.16.27\">27</a><sup>(</sup>×2<sup>)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:9\" href=\"/Numbers.26.9\">26:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.6\">Dt 11:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:17\" href=\"/Psalms.106.17\">ψ 106:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Hiel the Bethelite <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.34\">1 K 16:34</a>. Cf. also following.","next":"BDB, אַבְרָם","prev":"BDB, אֲבִי הָעֶזְרִי"}